    ],
    "text": "AS PER THE CLAUSE No. 42(2) K OF THE DIVINEGUMA ACT, No. 01 OF 2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      353.05,
      539.94,
      436.12
    ],
    "text": "I, Sajith Premadasa, the Minister of Housing and Samurdhi, as per the powers vested in me by the Clause No. 42(2)K of theDivineguma Act, No. 01 of 2013, hereby order, to set-off the the total contribution along with the relevant interest on suchcontribution to be paid by the officer to the Widow and Orphan Pension (W&OP) with effect from his first date of appointmentof the Authority concerned up to 03.01.2014, against the total contribution, i. e. 20% contribution jointly made to theEmployees' Provident Fund by the officer and the Government from the gross salary of the officers up to the date of03.01.2014, considering the contribution made by the relevant Authority to the Employees' Provident Fund as per the ClauseNo. 44 (e) ii of the Divineguma Act No. 01 of 2013, and pay the balance amount of money to the employee.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
